  <item>
    <title>vol.23 电子榨菜品鉴小会：喜剧综艺和情景喜剧</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/644cea67efd66e74daa0a12a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">644cea67efd66e74daa0a12a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 29 Apr 2023 09:02:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>之前我们聊了一期单口喜剧，而这期我们聊了聊喜剧综艺《一年一度喜剧大赛》、《认真的嘎嘎们》和一些我们看过的情景喜剧。我们聊了聊各自喜欢的和不喜欢的喜剧类型；什么样的喜剧是高级的喜剧；美国情景喜剧和英国情景喜剧的区别等等。本期内容所有观点非常主观，仅代表主播个人意见。</span></p><p><span>同时欢迎关注我们的微信公众号 Waiting2Talk。</span></p><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><p><span>丝柏 恒星 杜1</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="225">00:03:45</a>&nbsp; 有没有觉得“一年一度喜剧大赛”这个名字很别扭？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="285">00:04:45</a>&nbsp; 为什么没那么喜欢“某某某”？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="684">00:11:24</a>&nbsp; “少爷和我”和“老师好”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1057">00:17:37</a>&nbsp; 看《妈妈的味道》，竟然还笑得挺开心的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1242">00:20:42</a>&nbsp; 认真的嘎嘎们——“嘎嘎”是什么意思？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1616">00:26:56</a>&nbsp; 小婉管乐在嘎嘎们里的精彩表现</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1858">00:30:58</a>&nbsp; 喜剧有没有高级不高级之分？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2185">00:36:25</a>&nbsp; 什么样的喜剧是高级的？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2664">00:44:24</a>&nbsp; 开始聊情景喜剧……</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2764">00:46:04</a>&nbsp; 最开始看的情景喜剧是什么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3177">00:52:57</a>&nbsp; 《东北一家人》让人印象深刻的情节</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3419">00:56:59</a>&nbsp; “美式”情景喜剧的陪伴感</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3801">01:03:21</a>&nbsp; “英式”情景喜剧的荒谬和夸张</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4117">01:08:37</a>&nbsp; 现在为什么没有好的情景喜剧了？</span></p><p><span>提到的剧：</span></p><p><span>《家有儿女》</span></p><p><span>《武林外传》</span></p><p><span>《东北一家人》</span></p><p><span>《编辑部的故事》</span></p><p><span>《我爱我家》</span></p><p><span>《宋飞传》</span></p><p><span>《老友记》</span></p><p><span>《冤家成双对》</span></p><p><span>《IT狂人》</span></p><p><span>《是，大臣》</span></p><p><span>《伦敦生活》</span></p><br>]]></description>
