  <item>
    <title>vol.22 咖啡爱好者的不装X指南</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64357f5f6341155b51bb6a92</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64357f5f6341155b51bb6a92</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 11 Apr 2023 15:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期“时间胶囊”距离录制时间已经过去了差不多一年了。剪完丝柏回听的时候倍感羞耻，说：“谁**喝手冲咖啡加奶泡啊！”看到之后我刚喝一口的水直接笑喷出来。笑完之后连忙查了一下，为啥手冲咖啡不加奶泡。</span></p><p><span>这期我们邀请了之前邀请过的嘉宾Stanley，一名资深的咖啡爱好者，聊了聊他与咖啡的故事。本期可能会听到：中国咖啡和美国咖啡的区别；咖啡店里遇到的趣事；咖啡器材推荐；以及主播和咖啡之间的故事……&nbsp; 同时欢迎关注我们的微信公众号 Waiting2Talk。</span></p><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><p><span>丝柏 丹哥 Stanley</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="32">00:00:32</a>&nbsp; 你咖啡自由了吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">00:05:30</a>&nbsp; 什么样的咖啡可以让自己满足？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="547">00:09:07</a>&nbsp; 中国咖啡和美国咖啡的区别</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="894">00:14:54</a>&nbsp; 咖啡店里遇到的奇怪趣事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1148">00:19:08</a>&nbsp; 在青岛一天喝七八个double shot喝伤了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1685">00:28:05</a>&nbsp; 拿铁鄙视链顶端的“平白”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2055">00:34:15</a>&nbsp; 怎样和咖啡师快速打开话题</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2647">00:44:07</a>&nbsp; 咖啡师的必备技能是讲故事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2930">00:48:50</a>&nbsp; 电影现场最佳拍档，咖啡和烟</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3430">00:57:10</a>&nbsp; 咖啡可以放多久？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3826">01:03:46</a>&nbsp; 为什么不推荐极浅烘焙的咖啡豆？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4098">01:08:18</a>&nbsp; Stanley与咖啡结缘的故事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4969">01:22:49</a>&nbsp; 上海好像比以前冷清了很多</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5225">01:27:05</a>&nbsp; 推荐hario的磨豆机</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5667">01:34:27</a>&nbsp; 排队八小时买杯咖啡</span></p>]]></description>
