  <item>
    <title>vol.17 五一特别篇·我不是真的想卷</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/626f84c1e2870ce7771343fa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">626f84c1e2870ce7771343fa</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 02 May 2022 06:33:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>五一劳动节，当然要聊聊工作。所以邀请了一位在大厂工作的朋友Lina，来和我们聊聊工作中那些令我们开心或者不开心的事情。祝大家五一假期开心。 &nbsp;&nbsp;同时欢迎关注我们的微信公众号 Waiting2Talk</span></p><p><span>【本期主播与嘉宾】</span></p><p><span>丝柏 @等待群聊</span></p><p><span>小杜 @杜1-</span></p><p><span>Lina</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">00:01:35</a>&nbsp; 结缘于吐槽小杜</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="299">00:04:59</a>&nbsp; 三位不同“大厂”的人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">00:08:00</a>&nbsp; 莆田在假鞋圈其实是高端的代名词</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="778">00:12:58</a>&nbsp; 互联网黑话“后遗症”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="981">00:16:21</a>&nbsp; 大家的工作节奏是什么样的？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1425">00:23:45</a>&nbsp; 你们加班真的有活干吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1634">00:27:14</a>&nbsp; “难得老板有同理心！”说说工作中那些负面情绪。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2034">00:33:54</a>&nbsp; 工作中的真空时间（午睡真的很重要）。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2487">00:41:27</a>&nbsp; 职场生存之道</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2954">00:49:14</a>&nbsp; 那些最爱的、相爱的、可爱的同事们</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3634">01:00:34</a>&nbsp; 之前的工作经历</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4041">01:07:21</a>&nbsp; “三千块钱还不够我病的吗？”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4344">01:12:24</a>&nbsp; 你觉得你在同事心中是怎样的人？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4717">01:18:37</a>&nbsp; 来，一起反卷</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5218">01:26:58</a>&nbsp; 那些排解压力的方法</span></p><br><br>]]></description>
